window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v26-099-493fb54abdeca4da.json"]={sha256:"493fb54abdeca4da6b427d6dda52d2530f3c55976ca73b05869a98a27c81018f",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-571b75f6e0d45b7e","url":"https://sre.google/sre-book/postmortem-culture/","title":"Google SRE: postmortem culture","titleEn":"Google SRE: postmortem culture","publisher":"Google SRE","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-099","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-099","related":[{"id":"security-v26-100","referenceUrls":["https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/84/final"],"title":"NIST整合桌上演練：從警示到復原驗收","titleEn":"NIST integrated tabletop: from alert to recovery acceptance","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付事件時間線、促成因素圖、12項可驗證行動及後續追蹤結果。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the event timeline, contributing-factor map, twelve verifiable actions and follow-up results.","difference":"制定學習目標、角色、注入卡、停止條件及評估表，讓每次決策都留下證據與未決事項。","differenceEn":"Define objectives, roles, inject cards, stop conditions and evaluation criteria, recording evidence and unresolved questions at each decision.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["有效完成率=已有驗證證據的改善行動/已承諾行動；工單關閉不等於控制有效。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 事後檢討承諾12項行動，9張工單已關閉，但只有7項有可重跑驗證。 工單關閉率75%，有效完成率7/12=58.3333%。","演練達標率=具備證據的達標目標/預先定義目標；完成劇情不等於全部能力已驗證。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 演練有10個目標：證明驗證2、分流2、保全2、復原2、溝通2；首輪7個有證據達標。 首輪達標率7/10=70%；三個缺口分別要有原因與補測。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Effective completion is verified improvements divided by committed actions; a closed ticket does not prove effectiveness. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. A postmortem commits to twelve actions; nine tickets are closed, but only seven have repeatable validation. Ticket closure is 75%, but effective completion is 58.3333%.","Exercise attainment counts evidenced objectives over predefined objectives; finishing the story does not validate every capability. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. Ten objectives cover two each for provenance, triage, preservation, recovery and communication; seven have evidence in the first round. First-round attainment=70%; each of three gaps needs a reason and retest.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v26-009","referenceUrls":["https://www.openpolicyagent.org/docs/policy-language"],"title":"Open Policy Agent：拒絕預設與授權真值表","titleEn":"Open Policy Agent: default deny and authorization truth tables","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付事件時間線、促成因素圖、12項可驗證行動及後續追蹤結果。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the event timeline, contributing-factor map, twelve verifiable actions and follow-up results.","difference":"建立三個角色、四種資源、兩種動作的授權矩陣；先把需要允許的格子明確列出，缺值與未知角色走拒絕。","differenceEn":"Build an authorization matrix with three roles, four resources and two actions; enumerate allowed cells explicitly and deny missing values or unknown roles.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["有效完成率=已有驗證證據的改善行動/已承諾行動；工單關閉不等於控制有效。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 事後檢討承諾12項行動，9張工單已關閉，但只有7項有可重跑驗證。 工單關閉率75%，有效完成率7/12=58.3333%。","完整笛卡兒積測試數=角色數×資源數×動作數；測試覆蓋不等於每格都允許，缺少測試也不能解讀為拒絕正確。 基準3角色、4資源、2動作；每組合建立一筆本機JSON輸入和預期布林結果。 3×4×2=24項；增加一個唯讀角色後4×4×2=32項，原24項需全部保留。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Effective completion is verified improvements divided by committed actions; a closed ticket does not prove effectiveness. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. A postmortem commits to twelve actions; nine tickets are closed, but only seven have repeatable validation. Ticket closure is 75%, but effective completion is 58.3333%.","Complete Cartesian tests equal roles×resources×actions; coverage does not mean every case allows, and an untested cell is not a proven denial. Baseline: 3 roles, 4 resources and 2 actions, each combination represented by local JSON and an expected Boolean. 3×4×2=24 tests; adding a read-only role gives 4×4×2=32, retaining all original 24.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-c666997afcd05e3f","url":"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/84/final","title":"NIST SP 800-84: test, training and exercise programs","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-84: test, training and exercise programs","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-c3cbdf597df4c7fc","url":"https://www.openpolicyagent.org/docs/policy-language","title":"Open Policy Agent: Policy Language","titleEn":"Open Policy Agent: Policy Language","publisher":"Open Policy Agent","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
